      <h2 class="c50"><span class="c9">Sub.: Consent to publish the name of the banker(s) and the details of credit facilities rated in the press release.</span></h2>
      <p class="c55"><span class="c4"></span></p>
      <p class="c53"><span class="c9">Dear {!Contact.Salutation} {!Contact.LastName},</span></p>
      <p class="c20"><span class="c9"></span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c5">We wish to draw your attention to the guidelines issued by the Reserve Bank of India (</span><span class="c9">&ldquo;RBI&rdquo;</span><span class="c5">) vide letter dated June 4, 2021 wherein RBI has directed all credit rating agencies(</span><span class="c9">&ldquo;CRAs&rdquo;</span><span class="c5">) to disclose the names of the specific banks and their credit facilities rated in the press release. Further, RBI has directed CRAs to take a consent from the rated entities.</span></p>
      <p class="c55"><span class="c10"></span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c5">Reference is also made to the existing rating agreement(s) between your Company and ICRA Limited (&ldquo;</span><span class="c9">ICRA</span><span class="c5">&rdquo;) with respect to the rating(s) provided to you (&ldquo;</span><span class="c9">Rating Agreement(s)</span><span class="c5">&rdquo;). Accordingly, ICRA has made necessary changes to the Rating Agreement(s) through this addendum (&ldquo;</span><span class="c9">Addendum</span><span class="c5">&rdquo;).</span></p>
      <p class="c12"><span class="c5"></span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c5">Notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in the Rating Agreement(s), you hereby agree to the following modification to the Rating Agreement(s):</span></p>
      <p class="c12"><span class="c5"></span></p>
      <p class="c6"><span class="c2">&ldquo;The Company shall provide the names of the specific banks along with the type and amounts of the Bank Facility(s) rated / to be rated by ICRA in the following format &ndash;</span></p>
      <p class="c12"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <a id="t.cd7a63b67c0d9474a29d874ce3b16f08d9ee6ade"></a><a id="t.0"></a>
      <table class="c36">
         <tbody>
            <tr class="c27">
               <td class="c17" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
