      <p class="c52"><span class="c60"></span></p>
      <p class="c40"><span class="c2">The Company shall immediately intimate ICRA of any changes in the names of the specific banks and / or changes in the type and amounts of the Bank Facility(s) rated. In case of unallocated limits, the Company shall inform ICRA of the name of the specific banks immediately on allocation of the limits. The Company hereby provides its consent and authorizes ICRA to publish the name of the bank(s) along with the type and amount of the Bank Facility(s) rated in the press release.&rdquo;</span></p>
      <p class="c48"><span class="c35"></span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c5">This Addendum supplements the Rating Agreement(s) and all of the terms and conditions of the Rating Agreement(s) apply to this Addendum with effect from &nbsp; <apex:outputText value="{0,date,MMMM d','  yyyy}"  ><apex:param value="{!today()}"/> </apex:outputText>; provided that to the extent there is a conflict between this Addendum and the Rating Agreement(s), the terms of this Addendum shall control.</span></p>
      <p class="c20"><span class="c5"></span></p>
      <p class="c11"><span class="c5">Please share this signed Addendum within 7 (seven) days of receipt. The Company undertakes to intimate ICRA immediately in case if there is any change in the bankers(s), type and amount of Bank Facility(s) rated.</span></p>
      <p class="c48"><span class="c10"></span></p>
      <p class="c31"><span class="c5">Should you have questions, please do not hesitate to contact us.</span></p>
      <p class="c52"><span class="c41"></span></p>
      <p class="c62"><span class="c5">Regards,</span></p>
      <p class="c37"><span class="c5">Yours sincerely</span></p>
  
      <p class="c37 c58"><span class="c5"></span></p>
